Description: Test that what the nested main loop at shutdown dispatches reaches no destroyed actor.
 Adds the shell test signalsDuringShutdown, which emits, from within the time limits manager's shutdown, and so from
 within its nested main loop, the signals of objects which outlive the shell's actors and which the app system, the
 date menu and Main.sessionMode deliver to actors. Without run-time-limits-shutdown-first.patch the actors are
 destroyed by then, and the first critical GJS logs fails the test. The test opens no window, so no client writes to
 the shader cache while the test's home directory is removed.
Author: Mitar
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-06

